# Normalize to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# The bundle writer writes LF explicitly so a bundle generated on Windows and
# one generated in CI compare byte-for-byte, and a test asserts it. Letting
# core.autocrlf rewrite the sources would make that guarantee depend on the
# contributor's git configuration.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
